"\n"
"Default: \"main\" (latest development branch)\n"
"Examples: \"main\", \"v1.12\", \"v1.11\"\n"
"\n"
"<b>The configuration.lua will be preserved.</b>"
msgstr ""
"Introdueix un nom de branca o etiqueta per actualitzar el connector des del repositori font.\n"
"\n"
"<b>URL de Github:</b>  %1\n"
"<b>Repositori font:</b>  %2\n"
"\n"
"Per defecte: \"main\" (branca de desenvolupament més recent)\n"
"Exemples: \"main\", \"v1.12\", \"v1.11\"\n"
"\n"
"<b>El configuration.lua es conservarà.</b>"

